- What?

269
00:12:58,033 --> 00:12:59,267
You're out right away!

270
00:12:59,400 --> 00:13:00,467
- You're immediately out.
- Yes!

271
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:03,767
But if you manage to catch it,

272
00:13:03,900 --> 00:13:06,000
