- No, he did that on purpose.

293
00:13:50,533 --> 00:13:51,300
I saw it.

294
00:13:51,433 --> 00:13:52,700
It was an accident.

295
00:13:52,833 --> 00:13:54,333
I saw it, I promise.

296
00:13:54,500 --> 00:13:55,967
- It was intentional.
- Okay, go.

297
00:13:56,100 --> 00:13:58,000
All right, back to positions
everyone!

298
00:13:58,133 --> 00:13:59,100
Back to positions!

299
00:13:59,233 --> 00:14:00,900
He did it on purpose.

300
00:14:02,567 --> 00:14:03,700
Ready, volunteers?

301
00:14:03,833 --> 00:14:05,467
Are the volunteers ready?

302
00:14:05,600 --> 00:14:08,133
Yes!

303
00:14:08,267 --> 00:14:10,200
- Go, pass!
- Pass!

304
00:14:10,567 --> 00:14:12,300
Okay, step backward.

305
00:14:12,433 --> 00:14:13,967
Step back!

306
00:14:14,100 --> 00:14:15,400
- There, ready...
- Ready?

307
00:14:15,533 --> 00:14:17,333
Pass!

308
00:14:17,900 --> 00:14:19,767
Oh!

309
00:14:19,900 --> 00:14:21,367
