314
00:14:30,400 --> 00:14:31,300
Ouch!

315
00:14:31,433 --> 00:14:32,267
Why me too?

316
00:14:32,400 --> 00:14:33,900
Hey, me too!

317
00:14:34,933 --> 00:14:37,033
You cannot do that, Jin Ho.

318
00:14:38,233 --> 00:14:42,567
As a penalty, your group
