337
00:15:45,433 --> 00:15:47,733
We should understand each other.

338
00:15:48,400 --> 00:15:50,833
- So, please.
- Of course, I'm good...

339
00:15:50,967 --> 00:15:55,100
But only if Andrew promises
not to do it again.

340
00:15:56,533 --> 00:15:57,733
Right, so it's fair.

341
00:15:57,867 --> 00:15:59,067
Right, Joey?

342
00:15:59,200 --> 00:16:01,533
Suit yourselves.

343
00:16:01,667 --> 00:16:03,133
Move aside.

344
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:07,300
