345
00:16:20,300 --> 00:16:22,000
Andrew...

346
00:16:26,033 --> 00:16:28,133
Sorry about those two.

347
00:16:28,267 --> 00:16:30,667
Wait, why are you the one
apologizing for them?

348
00:16:31,367 --> 00:16:32,933
Nothing...

349
00:16:33,067 --> 00:16:36,100
I just don't want
our day to be ruined

350
00:16:36,233 --> 00:16:37,567
because of that.

351
00:16:37,700 --> 00:16:39,133
And honestly, I was just
surprised

352
00:16:39,267 --> 00:16:42,033
