358
00:16:56,667 --> 00:16:58,300
Now, I get it.

359
00:16:58,800 --> 00:17:02,067
I understand why you like
Joey so much.

360
00:17:02,200 --> 00:17:03,867
- Huh?
- Look at her.

361
00:17:04,367 --> 00:17:08,467
She's very pretty, very nice,

362
00:17:08,600 --> 00:17:10,633
