365
00:17:18,200 --> 00:17:20,400
<i>Come on, Jin Ho,
please join us.</i>

366
00:17:20,533 --> 00:17:22,900
<i>I know you're busy with Theresa.</i>

367
00:17:23,033 --> 00:17:24,333
<i>You know, if only
I could help you,</i>

368
00:17:24,467 --> 00:17:26,233
<i> I would have already done it.</i>

369
00:17:26,733 --> 00:17:27,700
<i> You'd do that for me?</i>

370
00:17:27,833 --> 00:17:29,500
<i>Of course, you're my friend,
right?</i>

371
00:17:29,633 --> 00:17:30,733
<i> And friends should have fun.</i>

372
00:17:30,867 --> 00:17:31,933
<i> So let's go.</i>

373
00:17:32,067 --> 00:17:33,167
What do you say? Game?

374
00:17:33,300 --> 00:17:35,800
Wait, you're going
to compete with me too?

375
00:17:35,933 --> 00:17:37,500
No.

376
00:17:37,633 --> 00:17:40,067
I mean, bro code.
We are friends, right?

377
00:17:42,100 --> 00:17:43,633
Good.

378
00:17:45,367 --> 00:17:46,367
Besides.

379
00:17:46,500 --> 00:17:47,333
I have other things in mind.

380
00:17:47,467 --> 00:17:48,967
I can't like anyone right now.

381
00:17:49,733 --> 00:17:51,500
