382
00:17:52,600 --> 00:17:53,433
Nothing.

383
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:55,233
Why would that happen?

384
00:17:55,367 --> 00:17:56,300
Hey, that's impossible.

385
00:17:56,433 --> 00:17:58,300
I'm that gorgeous.

386
00:17:59,900 --> 00:18:01,233
That's actually true.

387
00:18:01,367 --> 00:18:02,467
Oh...

388
00:18:02,600 --> 00:18:04,067
But still, that's impossible.

389
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:05,167
You know why?

390
00:18:05,300 --> 00:18:06,633
Because Peter is my best friend.

391
00:18:06,767 --> 00:18:08,467
He's just a buddy to me.

392
00:18:08,600 --> 00:18:10,333
And Jin Ho? There are so many
