394
00:18:12,100 --> 00:18:15,400
What you really mean is
it's just your male ego.

395
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:20,267
That's why you two
are competing.

396
00:18:21,300 --> 00:18:22,867
You're cute, you know that?

397
00:18:25,367 --> 00:18:28,967
I mean you're cute because...

398
00:18:29,100 --> 00:18:32,000
