- Ready!

413
00:19:16,233 --> 00:19:18,633
All right, we'll use
everything we can, okay?

414
00:19:18,767 --> 00:19:20,033
We have to win.

415
00:19:20,167 --> 00:19:21,900
Okay, game.

416
00:19:22,033 --> 00:19:23,367
- Game? Game?
- All right, game!

417
00:19:23,500 --> 00:19:24,633
One, two, three, win!

418
00:19:24,767 --> 00:19:26,633
Win!

419
00:19:27,333 --> 00:19:28,633
So, are you ready?

420
00:19:28,800 --> 00:19:30,667
One, two, three, Team "Panalo!"

421
00:19:30,800 --> 00:19:31,833
One, two, three...

422
00:19:31,967 --> 00:19:33,600
- Team "Panalo!"
- Team "Panalo!"

423
00:19:33,733 --> 00:19:35,233
Let's go!

424
00:19:35,833 --> 00:19:37,400
Okay guys, listen.

425
00:19:37,533 --> 00:19:39,633
