my friend.

496
00:23:02,900 --> 00:23:03,900
Theresa...

497
00:23:07,533 --> 00:23:08,800
So you're going to catch
Theresa?

498
00:23:08,933 --> 00:23:09,900
Yes.

499
00:23:10,033 --> 00:23:11,033
They said Parak's belongings

500
00:23:11,167 --> 00:23:12,333
